.611">really </span><span begin="00:34.611" end="00:34.673">need </span><span begin="00:34.673" end="00:36.362">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.926" end="00:42.620"><span begin="00:38.926" end="00:39.177">But </span><span begin="00:39.177" end="00:39.299">if </span><span begin="00:39.299" end="00:39.549">we </span><span begin="00:39.549" end="00:39.985">all </span><span begin="00:39.985" end="00:40.363">stand </span><span begin="00:40.363" end="00:40.671">up </span><span begin="00:40.671" end="00:40.924">in </span><span begin="00:40.924" end="00:41.174">the </span><span begin="00:41.174" end="00:41.361">name </span><span begin="00:41.361" end="00:41.861">of </span><span begin="00:41.861" end="00:42.620">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.861" end="00:45.865"><span begin="00:42.861" end="00:43.051">And </span><span begin="00:43.051" end="00:43.361">state </span><span begin="00:43.361" end="00:43.613">the </span><span begin="00:43.613" end="00:43.930">case </span><span begin="00:43.930" end="00:44.114">of </span><span begin="00:44.114" end="00:44.361">what </span><span begin="00:44.361" end="00:44.741">we're </span><span begin="00:44.741" end="00:44.987">dreamin' </span><span begin="00:44.987" end="00:45.865">of</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.737" end="00:49.677"><span begin="00:46.737" end="00:47.049">I've </span><span begin="00:47.049" end="00:47.364">got </span><span begin="00:47.364" end="00:47.551">to </span><span begin="00:47.551" end="00:47.805">say </span><span begin="00:47.805" end="00:47.990">I </span><span begin="00:47.990" end="00:48.237">only </span><span begin="00:48.237" end="00:48.485">dream </span><span begin="00:48.485" end="00:48.804">of </span><span begin="00:48.804" end="00:49.677">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.552" end="00:53.113"><span begin="00:50.552" end="00:50.745">But </span><span begin="00:50.745" end="00:51.051">like </span><span begin="00:51.051" end="00:51.245">a </span><span begin="00:51.